      "status": "draft-not-run",
      "subject": {
        "path": "code-examples/swiftui/ios-v1/evaluation/preferences.prompt.md",
        "sha256": "7331721435c05211af1942acb0bfed69b4722fdffac1eed6a7fba557ea0ee7d0",
        "text": "Target iOS26, SwiftUI.\n\nBuild a SwiftUI status area with readable scalable text and selected/not-selected wording, not color alone. Respect reduced motion and reduced transparency without losing the final state or content. On platforms with the relevant system text-size environment, use a flexible layout policy for accessibility sizes. For TV26, keep readable semantic text but do not promise the TV27 system Larger Text feature.\n\nProvide complete code and focused compile/unit tests. No UI automation.\n"
      },
      "rubric": {
        "path": "code-examples/swiftui/ios-v1/evaluation/preferences.rubric.md",
