      "status": "draft-not-run",
      "subject": {
        "path": "code-examples/swiftui/ios-v1/evaluation/media.prompt.md",
        "sha256": "2ef8d48e375dbc193bbb232fe5bfc9dd480c9f1f8831c88d61fe309131bd54cc",
        "text": "Target iOS26, SwiftUI.\n\nOur SwiftUI player must keep the supplied AVPlayer and native controls. Build a synthetic, injected caption-options browser with stable IDs and localized names. Distinguish not-yet-loaded options from a successfully empty result. Preserve a selected ID through reordering, clear it when removed, reject unknown selections and duplicate IDs, and ignore old asynchronous option-list replies. Do not change volume or mute while browsing. This component records a preference only; applying AVMediaSelection and rendering captions are outside this task.\n\nProvide complete code and focused compile/unit tests. No UI automation.\n"
      },
      "rubric": {
